Pseudocode from Project 3:  
```
FUNCTION validate_user(username, password)
    IF users.txt EXISTS
        READ users.txt LINE BY LINE
            SPLIT line BY ','
            IF username AND password MATCH
                RETURN True
    RETURN False

ROUTE '/login' (POST)
    GET username AND password FROM FORM
    IF validate_user(username, password)
        SET session['username'] = username
        REDIRECT TO '/home'
    ELSE
        RENDER login.html WITH error="Invalid credentials"
```
